/* ProMicro nRF52840 (nice!nano v2 compatible) board overlay.
 *
 * Upstream board `nice_nano_v2` already sets LFCLK to the external 32.768 kHz
 * crystal, DCDC, and the UF2 bootloader layout. Keep this overlay minimal:
 * only project-specific tweaks (aliases, ADC for LiPo, retract unused nodes).
 */

/* Example: battery voltage divider on your ProMicro variant.
 * Uncomment and set the correct input once you verified the schematic.
 * VBAT is usually divided by 2, full scale 3.6 V -> use adc gain 1/6, ref 0.6 V.
 */
